n- **Filter by options**: Status, Priority, Assignee, Label, Project, Cycle\n- **Bulk actions**: Select multiple issues via checkboxes, then change status/priority/assignee/label\n- \"New Issue\" button opens a create issue modal\n\n**Issue Row Display:**\n- Checkbox for bulk selection\n- Priority icon (with color coding)\n- Team identifier prefix (e.g., `ENG-42`)\n- Title (clickable, navigates to issue detail)\n- Status icon (clickable to change status)\n- Labels as small colored badges\n- Assignee avatar\n- Due date (if set)\n- Project name (if assigned)\n\n### Mockup Images\n**No mockup image URLs found** - The AppSpec.md contains no image references, URLs, or mockup links. It is purely text-based specification with tables for statuses and priorities, but no visual mockups are embedded.\n\n### Full App Page Structure\nThe spec covers these pages:\n- Login/Sign Up pages\n- My Issues page\n- Inbox page\n- **Team Issues page** (your focus)\n- Issue Detail page\n- Create Issue Modal\n- Active Cycle page\n- Projects pages\n- Members, Teams, Labels, and Settings pages\n\nAll specifications are maintained in the two markdown files above with no additional revision tracking file."}],"totalDurationMs":14638,"totalTokens":34498,"totalToolUseCount":9,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":335,"cache_read_input_tokens":33611,"output_tokens":545,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":335},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
